{"id": "1725656", "name": "ישרים אפיניים במרחב R^3", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">ישר לינארי במרחב הוא תת מרחב (לינארי) של \\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\) שמימדו 1. כלומר, הוא מהצורה  \\(m = Span(v)\\) עבור  \\(0 \\ne v \\in \\mathbb{R}^3\\). </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"><strong>ישר אפיני </strong>הוא הזזה של ישר לינארי בוקטור קבוע. כלומר מהצורה \\(\\ell : w_1+m  = \\{w_1+\\alpha v  \\ | \\ \\alpha \\in \\mathbb{R}\\}\\). </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">ישנן 4 מצבים הדדים אפשריים בין שני ישרים אפיניים במרחב:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">1. מקבילים</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"> <img class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" src=\"data/1725656/files/1.png\" alt=\"ישרים מקבילים\" width=\"268\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">2. נחתכים</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"><img class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_middle\" src=\"data/1725656/files/2.png\" alt=\"ישרים נחתכים במרחב\" width=\"268\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">3. מתלכדים</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"> <img class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_middle\" src=\"data/1725656/files/3.png\" alt=\"ישרים מתלכדים במרחב\" width=\"268\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">4. מצטלבים</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"></p>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"><img class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_middle\" src=\"data/1725656/files/4.png\" alt=\"ישרים מצטלבים במרחב\" width=\"268\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">נתונים שני הישרים הבאים:</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">\\[\\ell_1: {{CT:0}}+t\\cdot {{CT:1}} ,   \\ell_2: {{CT:2}} + t\\cdot {{CT:3}}  \\]</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">1. מה המצב ההדדי בינהם? הזינו 1 עבור מקבילים. הזינו 2 עבור נחתכים. הזינו 3 עבור מתלכדים הזינו 4 עבור מצטלבים [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">2. מה המרחק בין שני הקווים? [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</span></p>\n<p></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p>Correct answer, well done.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p>Your answer is partially correct.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p>Incorrect answer.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "choice", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<p>תשובה נכונה</p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\"></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה שגויה</p>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "d", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה שגויה</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "ax", "b", "c", "cang", "choice", "d", "dx", "dy", "dz", "or1", "or1x", "or1y", "or1z", "or2", "or2x", "or2y", "or2z", "orth", "ox", "oy", "oz", "p", "q", "r", "r1", "r2", "tmp", "tmpx", "tmpy", "tmpz", "u1", "u2", "u3", "u4", "v1", "v1x", "v1y", "v1z", "v2", "v2x", "v2y", "v2z", "w1", "w2", "x0", "y0", "z0"], "nvariants": 50}